" Chrome"

#: gui/dialogs.py:705
msgid "&Browse..."
msgstr "Examinar..."

#: gui/dialogs.py:767
msgid ""
"No supported browser profiles were found.\n"
"\n"
"Cookies can be read directly from Firefox-based browsers (Firefox, LibreWolf, Waterfox, Floorp, Zen). Chrome-based browsers encrypt their cookies; use the \"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\" extension linked above and import the exported file instead."
msgstr ""
"No se encontraron perfiles de navegador compatibles.\n"
"\n"
"Las cookies pueden leerse directamente de navegadores basados en Firefox (Firefox, LibreWolf, Waterfox, Floorp, Zen). Los navegadores basados en Chrome cifran sus cookies; use la extensión \"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\" enlazada arriba e importe el archivo exportado."

